cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use landmine or landmine-bench, please cite it as below."
title: "landmine: known open bugs in your exact dependency versions, for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  landmine reads a project's lockfile, finds the open GitHub issues filed against the
  exact dependency versions it pins, and puts them where coding agents read them, with
  the workaround from each issue thread. It ships with landmine-bench, a benchmark of
  66 validated tasks measuring whether coding agents avoid open upstream bugs in pinned
  dependency versions.
type: software
authors:
